   "text": "Aaaah--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 360.24,
   "end": 363.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I will kill as many people as I have to as long as you are one of them!"
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 365.74,
   "end": 367.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 17",
   "text": "Oh hey, Eighteen, you're back!"
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 367.72,
   "end": 368.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 17",
   "text": "No cars yet."
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 368.76,
   "end": 371.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "You know there *is* a freeway over there, right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 371.46,
   "end": 373.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 17",
   "text": "Oh I know. This is just funner."
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 373.9,
   "end": 376.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "So Android, are you done running?"
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 376.42,
   "end": 378.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "I dunno. Is your mouth?"
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 378.1,
   "end": 379.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Well aren't you f*cking clever."
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 379.96,
   "end": 382.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "But wait! I have a retort."
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 383.54,
   "end": 384.32,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Truck horn"
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 384.32,
   "end": 386.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 17",
   "text": "Aw *yeah*! A tru--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 392.0,
   "end": 394.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 17",
   "text": "...Aw... *dick*...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 395.08,
   "end": 397.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Be honest... is this just a short guy thing?"
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 398.12,
   "end": 400.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You talk a lot of shit for a washing machine."
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 400.62,
   "end": 402.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "And no, I'm not just saying that 'cause you're an Android."
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 402.9,
   "end": 404.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I'm saying it because you're a wom--"
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 404.56,
   "end": 405.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "BAGH! HARGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 406.26,
   "end": 407.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Tcchh...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 407.2,
   "end": 409.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Hrrrrrrr...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 409.26,
   "end": 413.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You know what? Just for that... *I'm not gonna take it easy on you any m*--"
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 413.86,
   "end": 414.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "*AAGH*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 416.74,
   "end": 417.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 17",
   "text": "Hm."
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 419.42,
   "end": 420.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Father, are you in there?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 420.88,
   "end": 424.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Did anyone get the number of that *bitch*...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 424.68,
   "end": 425.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Eighteen."
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 425.74,
   "end": 426.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Thank you..."
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 426.96,
   "end": 428.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "You okay in there, Vegeta?"
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 428.48,
   "end": 429.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Eat a dick!"
